# A redundant H, refused, and a redundant dimension, made a reference. On the
# triangle, Horizontal on its base S1, which is level already: refused, and
# nothing added. Then Smart Dimension makes it fully constrained (d1, d2,
# d3 at their measured values) and measures T1 to T3, which d3 gives
# already: d4 is added as a reference dimension, the status bar says so, and
# no editor opens.
open tests/data/sketch-triangle.json
wait 16
action tool.horizontal
wait 2
click L 579 503
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.dimension
wait 2
click L 579 503
click L 579 547
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 689 339
click L 754 284
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 469 339
click L 404 284
wait 2
key Enter
wait 2
click L 360 503
click L 579 175
click L 447 197
wait 2
